docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.md:2001:### Task M2-08：接入终态触发与可恢复 generation job
docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.md:2007:**Description:** 实现 R30 终态观测 seam：`MemoryRuntime::observe_terminal(MemoryRecordEnvelopeV1)`（`observation` 必填、可選 `proposal`/`model_label`；另提供僅收 `TerminalObservationV1` 的薄封裝 `observe_terminal_observation` 供 M2-16D1）校验 host 上报并幂等入队，按规范输入指纹推进 generation，再用 lease/fence runner 驱动来源解析、host-injected compiler 与 MemoryWriter；同时从 Memory ref 观测 Confirmed Task revision 唤醒其已终态父 Intent。本卡不依赖已删除的 orchestrator，也不观察 Code-era `TaskEventKind`/`IntentEventKind`。
